            "review_text": "conscienciouseater\nAsia, Peru2982 contributions\n0\nWhen the original is less yummy than the copycat\nJun 2024 • Couples\nRead the review by LamN (2018) for the story of this restaurant’s confusing history. \nThe copycat one (at 94 DTH) is the better one, but it is closed for 2 days, so we went to the original one (now named Thúy, after its founder). While still digestible, it’s definitely less good. The spring rolls have more meat than crabmeat, and the batter for the soft shell crab is less refined.\nRead more\nWritten June 26, 2024",
