            "review_text": "zuluwarriors1879\nSingapore66 contributions\n0\nHighly overrrated\nMar 2023\nWe came here with high expectations especially after a personal recommendation. We ordered the glass noodles with crab, soft-shelled crabs and fried spring rolls. It came up to around a princely SGD$40. For that price in Saigon, the experience was greatly underwhelming. There was really nothing unique about the taste. \nThe coffee shop was clean and service fast. But nothing to bring me back again.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 16, 2023",
