            "review_text": "KC K\nAuckland, New Zealand65 contributions\n1\nThe food was OK but pricey\nJan 2019\nFollowing fabulous Youtube review, we decided to give it a try at this place with their well known soft-shell crab dishes. Due to the price tags, we ordered just 3 dishes, which included the deep fried soft-shell crab. The food turned not that extraordinary, but rather average which can be found throughout Hochiminh City. For that price we could get better deal elsewhere. We decided 3 dishes were enough. It's worth a try but the price wouldn't deserve a full meal.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 6, 2019",
