            "review_text": "Jason C\nBangkok, Thailand23 contributions\n0\ncrablicious mmmm so good\nSep 2018 • Friends\nwe went here as recommended by a local friend. not really knowing what i was getting into i found out this little mom and pop restaurant has been around for a while and now see why they have thrived. the crab dishes we ordered were superb and delicious. i reccomend the crab meat with the noodles and of course the whole large crab in the sweet sauce. i have already told my friends soon to visit hcmc this is a must stop for vietnamese dining. put it on your list to go. \nJason\nRead more\nWritten September 3, 2018",
