            "review_text": "On the road\n134 contributions\n0\nCrab softshell\nJan 2018 • Family\nSpecial for crabsoftshell, prices not cheap , but good to try. Manything wrote on menu for one small restaurant, but just choice some , not all. Softshell crab fries, similar like tempura, its very good, then salted fried shirm, third choice its seafood fried roll ( nem cua be). suggest drink fresh coconut, more clean, and try do not go to the back side, toilet... in the restaurant, don't order vermicelli stir fried with crab or crab soup for small children, still lot shell left inside, ctake care\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 31, 2018",
