            "review_title": "Review at 94 Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Babalu\nVancouver, BC233 contributions\n0\nCrab and more crab\nMar 2017 • Family\nHad a chance to try out this place and had expected more. While expecting basic diner style atmosphere meal was not very cheap by local standards.\n\nCrab fried rice had some nice 'wok hay' (cooking fire), deep fried crab is good if not just a bit too oily. Fresh grilled shrimp were a good size but not cheap and the tamarind sauce on the soft shell crab was da bomb but the crab itself was tiny and disappointing.\n\nOne local beer an 2 sodas and our bill was about $60 cdn. Pricey overall for food, location and perfunctory service. They even took back the vermicelli noodles on our table even though we had nibbled on it when we they realized we had not ordered fried spring rolls.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten March 13, 2017",
