            "review_title": "Review at 94 Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Levi J\nMelbourne, Australia6 contributions\n0\nGreasy soft shell crab\nDec 2016 • Solo\nCame here as a friend highly recommended it but I was a little disappointed as all the food I had in Vietnam has been fresh with salads and herbs. When I ate this soft shell crab it felt like I was eating late night greasy fried Chinese food. Do not order the deep fried soft shell crab. The old lady (look like the owner) looks unhappy. In fact I did not see any smiles from staff, must been a bad day to all of them. The beer was nice and cold though. the crab vermicelli and fried rice also looked good but I got put off with too much oil in the soft shell crab couldn't order anything else. I don't think I will be back or recommend it to anyone and very expensive comparison to others.\nRead more\nWritten December 14, 2016",
